  message: "From WI-losod (branch jgstern-agent/fix/losod, not merged): the Go `if err := cmd.Run(); err != nil` initializer is now a recorded statement, so its use of `cmd` is in the DDG. Measured with dev catalogue rows (exec.Command still rowed), containers-storage, claim untrusted-input-no-subprocess, source os.Stdin in unshareFn (cmd/containers-storage/unshare.go:12-27): base c1dd831558 gave one collapsed row ddg_mixed / not_attempted / source_not_tracked for sinks {Cmd.Run, exec.Command}; the losod branch gives Cmd.Run ddg / confirmed (line 23) and exec.Command ddg_mixed / not_attempted / sink_before_source (line 21, before the source at line 22). The Stdin field store did not block it here (WI-jahip's kill applies to a store that REDEFINES the receiver before a tainted use; here the tainted value enters via the store). I did not re-run INV-dukam's probe arm with exec.Command unrowed."  # 0af2
- op: discuss  # 5bec
